            "id": "https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/38824",
            "content_html": "<h3 dir=\"auto\">MDN URL</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/Streams_API/Using_writable_streams#writing\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/Streams_API/Using_writable_streams#writing</a></p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">What specific section or headline is this issue about?</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Writing example</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">What information was incorrect, unhelpful, or incomplete?</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">TextEncoder::encode method does not have parameters and returns Uint8Array</p>\n<div class=\"highlight highlight-source-js notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" dir=\"auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"const encoder = new TextEncoder();\nconst encoded = encoder.encode(message, { stream: true }); // does not have stream parameter\"><pre class=\"notranslate\"><span class=\"pl-k\">const</span> <span class=\"pl-s1\">encoder</span> <span class=\"pl-c1\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">new</span> <span class=\"pl-v\">TextEncoder</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">(</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">)</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">;</span>\n<span class=\"pl-k\">const</span> <span class=\"pl-s1\">encoded</span> <span class=\"pl-c1\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-s1\">encoder</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">.</span><span class=\"pl-en\">encode</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">(</span><span class=\"pl-s1\">message</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">,</span> <span class=\"pl-kos\">{</span> <span class=\"pl-c1\">stream</span>: <span class=\"pl-c1\">true</span> <span class=\"pl-kos\">}</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">)</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">;</span> <span class=\"pl-c\">// does not have stream parameter</span></pre></div>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">What did you expect to see?</h3>\n<div class=\"highlight highlight-source-js notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" dir=\"auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"sendMessages([&quot;Hello, world.&quot;], writableStream);\n\nasync function sendMessage(messages, writableStream) {\n  // defaultWriter is of type WritableStreamDefaultWriter\n  const defaultWriter = writableStream.getWriter();\n  const encoder = new TextEncoder();\n  // TODO: close stream in case of encoder error\n  const chunks = messages.map((it) =&gt; encoder.encode(it));\n  chunks.forEach((chunk) =&gt; {       \n       try {\n           await defaultWriter.write(chunk);\n           console.log(&quot;Chunk written to sink.&quot;);\n       } catch(error) {\n           console.error(&quot;Chunk error:&quot;, error);\n       }\n  });\n  // Call ready again to ensure that all chunks are written\n  //   before closing the writer.\n  try {\n     await defaultWriter.ready;\n     console.log(&quot;All chunks written.&quot;);\n  } catch(error) {\n      console.error(&quot;Stream error:&quot;, error);\n   }\n}\"><pre class=\"notranslate\"><span class=\"pl-en\">sendMessages</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">(</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">[</span><span class=\"pl-s\">\"Hello, world.\"</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">]</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">,</span> <span class=\"pl-s1\">writableStream</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">)</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">;</span>\n\n<span class=\"pl-k\">async</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">function</span> <span class=\"pl-en\">sendMessage</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">(</span><span class=\"pl-s1\">messages</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">,</span> <span class=\"pl-s1\">writableStream</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">)</span> <span class=\"pl-kos\">{</span>\n  <span class=\"pl-c\">// defaultWriter is of type WritableStreamDefaultWriter</span>\n  <span class=\"pl-k\">const</span> <span class=\"pl-s1\">defaultWriter</span> <span class=\"pl-c1\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-s1\">writableStream</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">.</span><span class=\"pl-en\">getWriter</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">(</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">)</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">;</span>\n  <span class=\"pl-k\">const</span> <span class=\"pl-s1\">encoder</span> <span class=\"pl-c1\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">new</span> <span class=\"pl-v\">TextEncoder</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">(</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">)</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">;</span>\n  <span class=\"pl-c\">// TODO: close stream in case of encoder error</span>\n  <span class=\"pl-k\">const</span> <span class=\"pl-s1\">chunks</span> <span class=\"pl-c1\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-s1\">messages</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">.</span><span class=\"pl-en\">map</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">(</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">(</span><span class=\"pl-s1\">it</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">)</span> <span class=\"pl-c1\">=&gt;</span> <span class=\"pl-s1\">encoder</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">.</span><span class=\"pl-en\">encode</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">(</span><span class=\"pl-s1\">it</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">)</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">)</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">;</span>\n  <span class=\"pl-s1\">chunks</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">.</span><span class=\"pl-en\">forEach</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">(</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">(</span><span class=\"pl-s1\">chunk</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">)</span> <span class=\"pl-c1\">=&gt;</span> <span class=\"pl-kos\">{</span>       \n       <span class=\"pl-k\">try</span> <span class=\"pl-kos\">{</span>\n           <span class=\"pl-k\">await</span> <span class=\"pl-s1\">defaultWriter</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">.</span><span class=\"pl-en\">write</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">(</span><span class=\"pl-s1\">chunk</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">)</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">;</span>\n           <span class=\"pl-smi\">console</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">.</span><span class=\"pl-en\">log</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">(</span><span class=\"pl-s\">\"Chunk written to sink.\"</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">)</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">;</span>\n       <span class=\"pl-kos\">}</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">catch</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">(</span><span class=\"pl-s1\">error</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">)</span> <span class=\"pl-kos\">{</span>\n           <span class=\"pl-smi\">console</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">.</span><span class=\"pl-en\">error</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">(</span><span class=\"pl-s\">\"Chunk error:\"</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">,</span> <span class=\"pl-s1\">error</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">)</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">;</span>\n       <span class=\"pl-kos\">}</span>\n  <span class=\"pl-kos\">}</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">)</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">;</span>\n  <span class=\"pl-c\">// Call ready again to ensure that all chunks are written</span>\n  <span class=\"pl-c\">//   before closing the writer.</span>\n  <span class=\"pl-k\">try</span> <span class=\"pl-kos\">{</span>\n     <span class=\"pl-k\">await</span> <span class=\"pl-s1\">defaultWriter</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">.</span><span class=\"pl-c1\">ready</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">;</span>\n     <span class=\"pl-smi\">console</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">.</span><span class=\"pl-en\">log</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">(</span><span class=\"pl-s\">\"All chunks written.\"</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">)</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">;</span>\n  <span class=\"pl-kos\">}</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">catch</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">(</span><span class=\"pl-s1\">error</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">)</span> <span class=\"pl-kos\">{</span>\n      <span class=\"pl-smi\">console</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">.</span><span class=\"pl-en\">error</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">(</span><span class=\"pl-s\">\"Stream error:\"</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">,</span> <span class=\"pl-s1\">error</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">)</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">;</span>\n   <span class=\"pl-kos\">}</span>\n<span class=\"pl-kos\">}</span></pre></div>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Do you have any supporting links, references, or citations?</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/TextEncoder/encode\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/TextEncoder/encode</a></p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Do you have anything more you want to share?</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><em>No response</em></p>",
